/-!
# `Sec4_count_labelled`: 1,008,904 labelled median graphs on `{0,…,7}`; 20,160 lack (Q3′) and
20,160 lack (Q4)

(Written by Claude, 2026-09-28, while Codex was out of quota; the list of automorphism numbers is
generated by `gen_aut.py`, and each entry is proved in `MedianEightAut*`.)

Every median graph on `Fin 8` is isomorphic to exactly one representative `L8 j` (`cover8`,
`L8_pairwise`), and every graph isomorphic to `L8 j` is median. The graphs isomorphic to `L8 j`
number `8! / |Aut (L8 j)|` (`AutCount.orbit_card`), and these numbers add up to 1,008,904. The
median graphs without (Q3′) are exactly the copies of `G1`: every such graph is a copy of `G1` by
the uniqueness statement of Theorem A, and every copy of `G1` is median and lacks (Q3′) (Codex's
`ConcreteCore.G1_median`, `check_TheoremA_i`). Likewise the median graphs without (Q4) are exactly
the copies of `G2` (Theorem B, uniqueness; `ConcreteCore.G2_median`, `check_TheoremB_ii`). `G1`
and `G2` have two automorphisms each (`Sec4_aut`, Codex), so each class has `8! / 2 = 20,160`
members.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 8192

namespace ClaudePaper4

